From c75e096a7dd130ce97ce983bd7b1343f3093ed13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:07:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/65] Port the manual check (copy protection) and text input

Ports H009+$010C with $007E, the question table H049+$079E, the
random generator H023+$0010, string insert H026+$0254 and the line
input H030+$0718. The game data's executable is a cracked release: the
answer comparison's branches are NOPs, so any word passes, as here; the
routine still builds the $3F8F check word that main verifies. Choosing
Play now reaches the main menu (H013+$4BFC).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
